 "tree": "every file: node \"rig\" (turns the game's axes to y up, facing +z, metres), then the game's bones by name; do not animate \"rig\"",
 "notes": [
  "Agents with no base model in the game files use their first numbered variant (ctm_st6_variante, tm_leet_varianta, tm_balkan_variantf): my pick.",
  "idle and crouch_idle are the game's still poses with its breathing clip layered on at full strength, composed as the game composes additive clips.",
  "travel_mps is measured from the feet while planted, not a number from the game; the game scales playback to the speed moved.",
  "Twist, shoulder-blade and jiggle bones (extra_bones) are driven by the game's rig at run time and have no tracks: they stay at rest.",
  "Roughness is the game's where its texture carries it, otherwise 0.7; skin has no subsurface shading.",
  "head_in_bone_m and head_radius_m are fitted to each head mesh by this script, not the game's hit boxes.",
  "The rifle hangs from \"wpn\" with no offset, on the reading that a weapon model's own space is that bone's frame, as in first person.",
  "The death clips are the game's; it also has death_poses_* files (sets of poses, not played here) and leaves the rest to physics."
 ],
